meta {
  name: Ghbook Recovery
}

docs {
  Start ../start-recovery.sh, then select the Local environment.
  Catalog requests list JSON books through the local adapter.
  Downloads create persistent jobs and save files under ../downloads/.
  Download all books processes the entire catalog (about 62 GB of originals).
  Set convert_epub=true to also create EPUBs under ../epubs/.
  Start one job at a time; use Jobs to inspect, pause, resume, or retry it.
  Remote API requests call the recovered upstream endpoints directly.
}
